+ *
+ * Everything renders REAL data with explicit empty states:
+ *  * purchases carry their SOURCE (manual/holoo) — until the future Holoo
+ *    adapter writes rows, the tab shows the honest «اتصال برقرار نشده» note;
+ *  * visits come from real Visit/Checkin rows (notes, edit-history badges,
